   <name><text>s2_harf - Harf notu</text></name>
   <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><code>harf(not_)</code> fonksiyonunu yazın:</p>

<ul>
<li>90–100 → <code>AA</code></li>
<li>80–89 → <code>BA</code></li>
<li>70–79 → <code>BB</code></li>
<li>60–69 → <code>CB</code></li>
<li>50–59 → <code>CC</code></li>
<li>0–49 → <code>FF</code></li>
<li>0&#x27;dan küçük veya 100&#x27;den büyük → <code>Gecersiz</code></li>
</ul>]]></text></questiontext>
