   <answer><![CDATA[def harf(not_):
    if not_ < 0 or not_ > 100:
        return 'Gecersiz'
    if not_ >= 90:
        return 'AA'
    if not_ >= 80:
        return 'BA'
    if not_ >= 70:
        return 'BB'
    if not_ >= 60:
        return 'CB'
    if not_ >= 50:
        return 'CC'
    return 'FF'
]]></answer>
